      "result_description": "Ludgvan CC - 1st XI - Won",
      "result_applied_to": "22510",
      "match_notes": "A superb 2nd wicket partnership of 117 between talented young players Jack Paull , 72 , and Piran Kent , 58 , put Penzance in a commanding position , but a spirited fightback by the home team lead by spinner Scott Stevens with 5 for 47 , restricted the visitors to 179. Ludgvan openers Alex Westren with 99no & Scott Stevens with 50no batted superbly to see Ludgvan home , but massive respect to Penzance CC for adhering to the true spirit of cricket , by taking the field after a 55 minute rain delay to play the game to a finish.",
